{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","惊吓沼泽"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","躲进影子跟随目标移动，期间处于无敌状态，持续对目标造成伤害并吸收能量。之后跳出来对1格范围内的敌人造成伤害并恐惧。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","飞到敌人的影子并藏匿其中，每0.25秒对其造成36% ATK伤害，并吸收15 + 5点能量，最多持续5秒，持续期间自身处于无敌状态。随后从影子中跳出来对1格范围的敌人造成320% + 30% ATK伤害并恐惧4秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":89,"end":95,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":61,"end":63,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":85,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":102,"end":104,"tooltip_key":"keyword:fear"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","躲在影子里面每0.25秒对敌人造成的伤害提升至38% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","躲在影子里面每0.25秒对敌人造成的伤害提升至40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","躲在影子里面每0.25秒对敌人造成的伤害提升至42% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","躲在影子里面每0.25秒对敌人造成的伤害提升至45% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","影子戏法"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","躲进影子，若场上有孤立目标，会跳到孤立目标身边造成伤害，否则在影子中持续回复生命值，最后回到原位。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","躲进影子，期间自身处于无敌状态。若场上有孤立的敌人，还会依次移动到每个孤立的敌人身边，造成300% + 30% ATK伤害，否则会躲藏在影子中，并回复共300% ATK生命值。随后在原位置出现。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":55,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":20,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:lonely"},{"start":35,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:lonely"},{"start":45,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":76,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对孤立目标造成的伤害提升至310% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":1,"end":3,"tooltip_key":"keyword:lonely"},{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对孤立目标造成的伤害提升至320% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":1,"end":3,"tooltip_key":"keyword:lonely"},{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对孤立目标造成的伤害提升至350% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":1,"end":3,"tooltip_key":"keyword:lonely"},{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","恶魔契约"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","被击败后，贝利尔会躲进敌人影子中一段时间，期间贝利尔视为已被击败，但当场上有非召唤物的敌人被击败时，贝利尔会从这名敌人处复活并回复一定生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被击败后，贝利尔会躲藏在敌人的影子中，持续10秒。期间贝利尔视为已被击败，但当场上有非召唤物的敌人被击败时，则贝利尔会从被击败的这名敌人处重新加入战斗，并回复40% + 6% HP的生命值。该效果一场战斗内只会触发一次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":82,"end":87,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":79,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","重新上阵时回复的生命值提升至45% + 6% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","重新上阵时回复的生命值提升至50% + 6% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","重新上阵时回复的生命值提升至60% + 6% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","“孤立”状态的敌人造成伤害降低，受到伤害提升。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“孤立”状态的敌人造成伤害降低6%，受到伤害提升3%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“孤立”状态的敌人造成伤害降低8%，受到伤害提升4%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“孤立”状态的敌人造成伤害降低10%，受到伤害提升5%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","二重身"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","若场上有非召唤物的敌人持续处于孤立超过一定时间，会在目标身边出现一个目标的残影，残影会持续损失生命值并使用普通攻击对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若场上有非召唤物的敌人持续处于孤立超过3秒，则该敌人会失去180点能量并在身边出现一个目标的残影，残影继承贝利尔50%的攻击力、生命值和100%的其他属性，且每秒损失8%最大生命值，持续期间残影只会使用普通攻击对该目标造成伤害。同一个角色20秒内最多触发一次该效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"keyword:lonely"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","残影继承的攻击力、生命值提升至自身的70%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","残影对敌人造成伤害时，会使敌人损失40点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","残影继承的攻击力、生命值提升至自身的80%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","被击败后，技能“恶魔契约”躲藏时间延长。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被击败后，技能“恶魔契约”的躲藏时间延长10秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“二重身”对每名角色的触发时间降低至8秒。首次召唤残影后，自身和残影对敌人造成的能量损失效果提升50%。累计召唤3次残影后，残影将不再自动损失生命值。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","幻戏巫帽"]]}